<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>業務推進課 KPI管理</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f5f6fa;--white:#fff;--surface:#f0f2f8;--border:#e2e6f0;
  --text:#2d3561;--text2:#6b7399;--text3:#a8afc8;
  --blue:#5b8dee;--blue-lt:#eef3fd;
  --green:#34c48b;--green-lt:#edfbf4;
  --yellow:#f7b731;--yellow-lt:#fff8e6;
  --red:#fc5c65;--red-lt:#fff0f1;
  --purple:#a55eea;--purple-lt:#f5eeff;
  --pink:#f953c6;--pink-lt:#fef0fc;
  --radius:16px;
  --shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(45,53,97,.07);
  --shadow-md:0 4px 24px rgba(45,53,97,.11);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;min-height:100vh;font-size:14px}
.page{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 28px 80px}
.header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:24px}
.header h1{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800}
.header .sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:3px}
.header-right{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.pill{padding:6px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.pill-green{background:var(--green-lt);color:var(--green)}
.pill-yellow{background:var(--yellow-lt);color:#c97a00}
.update-bar{background:var(--green-lt);border:1px solid #b3edd5;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:12px;color:var(--green);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.legend{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px}
.legend-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)}
.legend-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:22px;background:var(--white);padding:6px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);width:fit-content;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{padding:9px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--text2);transition:all .2s;font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.tab:hover{background:var(--surface);color:var(--text)}
.tab.active-sasaki{background:var(--pink-lt);color:var(--pink)}
.tab.active-sano{background:var(--blue-lt);color:var(--blue)}
.tab.active-kase{background:var(--green-lt);color:var(--green)}
.tab.active-sakuma{background:var(--yellow-lt);color:#c97a00}
.tab-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.member-section{display:none}
.member-section.active{display:block;animation:fadeSlide .25s ease}
@keyframes fadeSlide{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.member-card{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:22px 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;border-left:5px solid}
.member-sasaki .member-card{border-left-color:var(--pink)}
.member-sano   .member-card{border-left-color:var(--blue)}
.member-kase   .member-card{border-left-color:var(--green)}
.member-sakuma .member-card{border-left-color:var(--yellow)}
.member-name{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800}
.member-role{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:3px}
.score-num{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:800;line-height:1}
.score-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:3px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px}
.chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;background:var(--white);color:var(--text2);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.chip-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.goals-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
@media(max-width:1024px){.goals-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.goal-card{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:box-shadow .2s}
.goal-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.goal-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px}
.goal-no{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:6px;line-height:1.4}
.goal-weight{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)}
.goal-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6px}
.goal-logic{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px}
.progress-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}
.progress-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)}
.progress-pct{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800}
.progress-track{height:10px;background:var(--surface);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:10px}
.progress-fill{height:100%;border-radius:5px;transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.slider-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
.slider-row label{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);white-space:nowrap}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;flex:1;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--border);outline:none;cursor:pointer}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--white);border:3px solid var(--blue);cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
.slider-val{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;min-width:36px;text-align:right}
.evidence-box{background:var(--surface);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.evidence-title{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:8px}
.evidence-item{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;padding:2px 0;display:flex;gap:6px}
.evidence-item::before{content:'·';color:var(--text3);flex-shrink:0}
em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.new-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;background:var(--green-lt);color:var(--green);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:4px;vertical-align:middle}
.goal-footer{margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.status-pill{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px}
.c-complete{color:var(--green)}.c-progress{color:var(--blue)}.c-caution{color:#c97a00}.c-alert{color:var(--red)}
.bg-complete{background:var(--green-lt);color:var(--green)}
.bg-progress{background:var(--blue-lt);color:var(--blue)}
.bg-caution{background:var(--yellow-lt);color:#c97a00}
.bg-alert{background:var(--red-lt);color:var(--red)}
.fill-complete{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),#5de4b0)}
.fill-progress{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),#85aefc)}
.fill-caution{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--yellow),#fcd86f)}
.fill-alert{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--red),#ff8a8e)}
.bottom-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
@media(max-width:768px){.bottom-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.panel{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:22px}
.panel-title{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.panel-icon{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0}
.action-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px}
.action-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface)}
.action-item.done{opacity:.45}
.action-item.done .action-text{text-decoration:line-through}
.action-check{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;border:2px solid var(--border);background:var(--white);cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;transition:all .15s;margin-top:1px;user-select:none}
.action-item.done .action-check{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:white}
.action-text{font-size:13px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.5;flex:1}
.add-row{display:flex;gap:8px}
.add-input{flex:1;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}
.add-input:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
.add-input::placeholder{color:var(--text3)}
.add-btn{padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;color:white;transition:opacity .15s;white-space:nowrap}
.add-btn:hover{opacity:.85}
.comment-ta{width:100%;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;resize:vertical;min-height:90px;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s;line-height:1.7}
.comment-ta:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
.comment-ta::placeholder{color:var(--text3)}
.comment-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px}
.save-hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)}
.save-btn{padding:9px 20px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;color:white;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple));transition:opacity .15s}
.save-btn:hover{opacity:.85}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
<div class="header">
  <div>
    <h1>📋 業務推進課 KPI管理</h1>
    <div class="sub">目標・進捗・ネクストアクション管理ダッシュボード</div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-right">
    <div class="pill pill-green">📅 2026.04.03 更新</div>
    <div class="pill pill-yellow">3Q 目標期間</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="update-bar">✅ <strong>Slack分析期間：2026年3月1日〜4月3日（最新）</strong>　4名の進捗を反映しました</div>
<div class="legend">
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></div>達成圏 (80〜100%)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></div>進行中 (50〜79%)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--yellow)"></div>要注意 (20〜49%)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--red)"></div>要介入 (0〜19%)</div>
</div>
<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tab active-sasaki" id="tab-sasaki" onclick="switchTab('sasaki')"><span class="tab-dot" style="background:var(--pink)"></span>佐々木 ゆみこ</button>
  <button class="tab" id="tab-sano"   onclick="switchTab('sano')">  <span class="tab-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></span>佐野 ほなみ</button>
  <button class="tab" id="tab-kase"   onclick="switchTab('kase')">  <span class="tab-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></span>加瀬 大智</button>
  <button class="tab" id="tab-sakuma" onclick="switchTab('sakuma')"><span class="tab-dot" style="background:var(--yellow)"></span>佐久間 友加里</button>
</div>

<!-- ===== 佐々木 ===== -->
<div id="sec-sasaki" class="member-section member-sasaki active">
  <div class="member-card">
    <div><div class="member-name">佐々木 ゆみこ</div><div class="member-role">業務推進課 メンバー</div></div>
    <div><div class="score-num c-progress" id="sasaki-total">—</div><div class="score-label">総合スコア / 100pt</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="chips">
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--yellow)"></div>インフル1週間療養→3/30復帰・Slack返信再開</div>
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></div>IRIAM・Pococha・ふわっちの3月売上記入・確認依頼（4/2）</div>
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></div>佐久間さんに目標シートを共有（3/30）</div>
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></div>加瀬さんへのメール前後確認を対応（3/31）</div>
  </div>
  <div class="goals-row">
    <div class="goal-card">
      <div class="goal-top"><span class="goal-no bg-progress">No.1</span><span class="goal-weight">配点 50pt</span></div>
      <div class="goal-title">【業務移管の完遂マネジメント】「佐野・佐々木がいなくても現場が回る」状態へ</div>
      <div class="goal-logic">佐野／佐々木が実務に割く時間を前Q比50%削減し、管理とAIに充てる。4Q：加瀬／佐久間への業務移管を7月末までに100%完了させる。</div>
      <div class="progress-row"><span class="progress-label">達成度</span><span class="progress-pct c-progress" id="sasaki-g1-pct">55%</span></div>
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill fill-progress" id="sasaki-g1-bar" style="width:55%"></div></div>
      <div class="slider-row"><label>調整</label><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="55" style="accent-color:var(--pink)" oninput="updateSlider('sasaki','g1',this.value)"><span class="slider-val c-progress" id="sasaki-g1-sv">55%</span></div>
      <div class="evidence-box">
        <div class="evidence-title">💬 Slack（3/1〜4/3）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">3月中旬にインフル療養→3/30に復帰しSlack返信再開</div>
        <div class="evidence-item"><em>佐久間さんに目標シートを共有</em>・4月の体制を整備（3/30）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">4月から佐久間さんが時短勤務でも回る体制を整える方針を全体へ共有（4/1）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">加瀬さんへのメール前後確認（3/31）・報酬計算の質問対応（4/2）</div>
      </div>
      <div class="goal-footer"><span class="status-pill bg-progress">移管推進中</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)">目標 100%</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="goal-card">
      <div class="goal-top"><span class="goal-no bg-progress">No.2</span><span class="goal-weight">配点 100pt</span></div>
      <div class="goal-title">【要件定義】社内のAI化依頼の要件定義・管理</div>
      <div class="goal-logic">社内から来るAI化依頼を受け、要件定義・管理を行う。</div>
      <div class="progress-row"><span class="progress-label">達成度</span><span class="progress-pct c-progress" id="sasaki-g2-pct">60%</span></div>
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill fill-progress" id="sasaki-g2-bar" style="width:60%"></div></div>
      <div class="slider-row"><label>調整</label><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="60" style="accent-color:var(--pink)" oninput="updateSlider('sasaki','g2',this.value)"><span class="slider-val c-progress" id="sasaki-g2-sv">60%</span></div>
      <div class="evidence-box">
        <div class="evidence-title">💬 Slack（3/1〜4/3）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">工数管理シートの自動アラートBot設定・運用開始（3/14〜3/15）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">ChatGPTで工数シート分析の活用方法を佐野さんと検討（3/13）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">インフル療養期間（約1週間）は要件定義関連の明示的な行動なし</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">復帰後は各種売上記入・確認業務に注力（4/2）</div>
      </div>
      <div class="goal-footer"><span class="status-pill bg-progress">進行中</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)">目標 100</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="goal-card">
      <div class="goal-top"><span class="goal-no bg-caution">No.3</span><span class="goal-weight">配点 2pt</span></div>
      <div class="goal-title">【自らAIを使い倒す（実践）】AIで実務改善・社外販売ツール作成を2件やり遂げる</div>
      <div class="goal-logic">難易度が高い、または全社波及効果が大きい業務を自らAI化し、成功事例を作る。</div>
      <div class="progress-row"><span class="progress-label">達成度</span><span class="progress-pct c-caution" id="sasaki-g3-pct">35%</span></div>
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill fill-caution" id="sasaki-g3-bar" style="width:35%"></div></div>
      <div class="slider-row"><label>調整</label><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="35" style="accent-color:var(--pink)" oninput="updateSlider('sasaki','g3',this.value)"><span class="slider-val c-caution" id="sasaki-g3-sv">35%</span></div>
      <div class="evidence-box">
        <div class="evidence-title">💬 Slack（3/1〜4/3）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">工数管理アラートBotの設定が自動化実績（3/14〜3/15）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">ChatGPTで工数シート分析を試行中（3/13）</div>
        <div class="evidence-item">インフル療養でAI実践が中断。「2件やり遂げる」完成事例はまだ確認できていない</div>
      </div>
      <div class="goal-footer"><span class="status-pill bg-caution">着手中・一時停滞</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)">目標 2件完成</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="bottom-row">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title"><span class="panel-icon" style="background:var(--pink-lt);color:var(--pink)">✅</span>ネクストアクション</div>
      <div class="action-list" id="sasaki-actions"></div>
      <div class="add-row">
        <input class="add-input" id="sasaki-action-input" placeholder="新しいアクションを追加..." onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')addAction('sasaki')">
        <button class="add-btn" style="background:var(--pink)" onclick="addAction('sasaki')">追加</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title"><span class="panel-icon" style="background:var(--purple-lt);color:var(--purple)">💬</span>マネージャーコメント</div>
      <textarea class="comment-ta" id="sasaki-comment" placeholder="佐々木さんへのフィードバック・所感を入力..."></textarea>
      <div class="comment-footer"><span class="save-hint">ブラウザに保存されます</span><button class="save-btn" onclick="saveComment('sasaki')">保存する</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== 佐野 ===== -->
<div id="sec-sano" class="member-section member-sano">
  <div class="member-card">
    <div><div class="member-name">佐野 ほなみ</div><div class="member-role">業務推進課 メンバー</div></div>
    <div><div class="score-num c-progress" id="sano-total">—</div><div class="score-label">総合スコア / 100pt</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="chips">
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></div>TikTokライバー管理システム稼働・継続運用中</div>
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></div>LINE未読対応の仕組み整備を主導（4/2）</div>
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></div>お腹の調子悪い日もリモートで稼働（3/31）</div>
    <div class="chip"><div class="chip-dot" style="background:var(--yellow)"></div>ライバー・特典制作依頼を継続対応中（3/26〜4/3）</div>
  </div>
  <div class="goals-row">
    <div class="goal-card">
      <div class="goal-top"><span class="goal-no bg-progress">No.1</span><span class="goal-weight">配点 20pt</span></div>
      <div class="goal-title">【業務のプロダクト化】引き継ぎを「資産化」に変える</div>
      <div class="goal-logic">担当全業務の棚卸しを実施し、マニュアル化・可視化を100%完了。後任へのレクチャー計画を策定し、自走できる形に整える。</div>
      <div class="progress-row"><span class="progress-label">達成度</span><span class="progress-pct c-progress" id="sano-g1-pct">65%</span></div>
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill fill-progress" id="sano-g1-bar" style="width:65%"></div></div>
      <div class="slider-row"><label>調整</label><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="65" style="accent-color:var(--blue)" oninput="updateSlider('sano','g1',this.value)"><span class="slider-val c-progress" id="sano-g1-sv">65%</span></div>
      <div class="evidence-box">
